\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{3}{6}{Design of the survey. All public execution blocks on the \NCensus {} targets are mined from the ALMA archive, positions propagated to each epoch from Gaia~DR3, and searched along the two independent lanes described in the text. Solid borders mark validated components; the validation rail summarises the injection-recovery (\NTrials {} trials, Appendix~\ref {app:inject}), chirp/periodicity and frequency-occupancy analyses}{figure.3}{}}
